\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {4}{\ignorespaces  \textbf  {Training dynamics and layer-wise adaptation profile of Agri-DINO.} \textbf  {(a)} Validation accuracy trajectories across 50 fine-tuning epochs. During the initial 5-epoch LP warmup (gray shaded region), the classifier head aligns to the pre-trained feature space while the backbone remains frozen. When LLRD fine-tuning begins at epoch~6, Agri-DINO ascends smoothly to 59.67\% on the fine-grained medicinal subset. \textbf  {(b)} LLRD multipliers $\eta _l/\eta _0 = \gamma ^{12-l}$ across the 12 transformer blocks. With $\gamma {=}0.75$ (green line), early blocks ($l\le 4$) receive less than 10\% of the base rate, protecting general edge/texture filters. }}{8}{figure.caption.10}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:dynamics}{{4}{8}{\textbf {Training dynamics and layer-wise adaptation profile of Agri-DINO.} \textbf {(a)} Validation accuracy trajectories across 50 fine-tuning epochs. During the initial 5-epoch LP warmup (gray shaded region), the classifier head aligns to the pre-trained feature space while the backbone remains frozen. When LLRD fine-tuning begins at epoch~6, Agri-DINO ascends smoothly to 59.67\% on the fine-grained medicinal subset. \textbf {(b)} LLRD multipliers $\eta _l/\eta _0 = \gamma ^{12-l}$ across the 12 transformer blocks. With $\gamma {=}0.75$ (green line), early blocks ($l\le 4$) receive less than 10\% of the base rate, protecting general edge/texture filters}{figure.caption.10}{}}
